From: AxionOS <noreply@axionos>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 22:22:29 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] AxThemePicker: return to the calling app after setting a
 wallpaper

WallpaperSetActivity is started by other apps (SET_WALLPAPER,
CROP_AND_SET_WALLPAPER with an image URI) and runs in the caller's
task. After applying, goHome() called restartApp(), which starts
MainActivity in a new task and leaves WallpaperSetActivity open on top
of the caller: the user lands in the theme picker, and going back to
the calling app shows the crop screen again.

goHome() now sets RESULT_OK and finishes, so the caller's task is
shown again.
---
 src/com/android/axion/themepicker/ui/WallpaperSetActivity.kt | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/com/android/axion/themepicker/ui/WallpaperSetActivity.kt b/src/com/android/axion/themepicker/ui/WallpaperSetActivity.kt
index d0e0466..44b62a2 100644
--- a/src/com/android/axion/themepicker/ui/WallpaperSetActivity.kt
+++ b/src/com/android/axion/themepicker/ui/WallpaperSetActivity.kt
@@ -228,7 +228,10 @@ class WallpaperSetActivity : ComponentActivity() {
         }
     }
 
-    private fun goHome() = restartApp()
+    private fun goHome() {
+        setResult(RESULT_OK)
+        finish()
+    }
 
     private fun isReadMediaPermissionGranted(): Boolean {
         return packageManager.checkPermission(Manifest.permission.READ_MEDIA_IMAGES, packageName) ==
